  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resettlement and family reunification programme with the government of Finland from various departure countries worldwide in 2026&#x2013;2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to facilitate resettlement as durable solution for 590 people in need of international protection in Iran (the Islamic Republic of), Peru, Rwanda, and T&#xfc;rkiye by facilitating their resettlement to Finland, as well as to facilitate regular pathways through family reunification for approximately 40 family members of beneficiaries of international protection residing in Finland. The project will run from March 2026 to February 2027.</narrative>
  </description>
